# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-drago02-0 = 
    Something is very wrong here. The land is withered and lifeless, and noxious mist curls through ruts and furrows. The trees are limbless, blasted stumps. What few blades of grass remain are seared and gray. A ruined village sits in the distance, smoke rising from its blackened shell. A wounded dog limps out of the ruined building, but when you try to help, it flees yelping. <br><p>
    你思索何等巨力竟致此毁灭。
msg-drago02-1 = 
    此村已遭大劫，房屋尽焚，田地荒芜，牲畜亦死。唯余断壁残垣，杂以未及逃生者之骸骨。此处无事可为。
